  "content": "[Intro]\n[F#]\n[F#7]\n[F#]\n[F#7]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[F#]Backbeat, the\nword on the street That the\n[F#7]fire in your heart is out\n[F#]I'm sure you've\nheard it before But you\n[F#7]never really had a doubt\n[F#]I don't believe that a-\n[F#7M]nybody\n[A7M]Feels the way I do\nabout you\n[C#]\n[A7M]\nAnd\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[A]all the roads that le-\n[B]ad us there are wind-\n[G#m7]ing\n[C#m7]And\n[A]all the lights that light\n[B]the way are blind-\n[G#m7]ing\n[C#m7]\n[A]There are many things\n[B]that I Would\n[E]like to [B]say to you\n[C#m7]But I don't know how\n[F#7]\n\n[Chorus]\n[A]Maybe\n[B]\n[E]Are you\ngonna be the one that saves\n[A]me\n[B]\n[E]\nAnd after\n[A]all\n[B]You're my wonderwall\n[E]\n[B]\n\n[Interlude]\n[E]\n[E7]\n[E]\n[E7]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[E]I don't believe that a-\n[E7M]nybody\n[G7M]Feels the way I do\nabout you\n[B]\n[G7M]\nAnd\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[G]all the roads that le-\n[A]ad you there are wind-\n[F#m7]ing\n[Bm7]And\n[G]all the lights that light\n[A]the way are blind-\n[F#m7]ing\n[Bm7]\n[G]There are many things\n[A]that I Would\n[D]like to [A]say to you\n[Bm7]But I don't know how\n[E7]\n\n[Chorus]\n[G]Maybe\n[A]\n[D]Are you\ngonna be the one that saves\n[G]me\n[A]\n[D]\nAnd after\n[G]all\n[A]You're my wonderwall\n[D7add13]",
